              p
                | Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Aperiam nemo harum ipsam labore. Tempore sequi ipsam dolorum, vel consectetur voluptatem. Quos quam aspernatur quibusdam quasi assumenda ea maxime repudiandae iste.
          .inner-wrap-2
            .inner-sort
              .inner-label Sắp xếp:
              a.inner-button(href="#")
                | Giá tăng dần
                i.fa-solid.fa-square-arrow-up-right
              a.inner-button(href="#")
                | Giá giảm dần
                i.fa-solid.fa-square-arrow-up-right.inner-rotate-90
              a.inner-button.active(href="#")
