            .inner-total
              | Tất cả:
              b 101 Tour
            button.inner-button-filter
              | Bộ Lọc
              img(
                alt="Filter" 
                src="client/assets/images/icon-filter.svg"
                )
          .inner-wrap-3
            .product-item
              a.inner-image(href="#")
                img(
                  alt="" 
                  src="/client/assets/images/demo/product-1.jpg"
                  )
              .inner-content
                .inner-discount
                  i.fa-solid.fa-bolt
                  | Giảm -30%
                h3.inner-title
                  a(href="#") Tour 2026 Phú Quốc – Thiên Đường Đảo Ngọc (3N2D) Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur
